    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken, curd, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, garam masala powder, cumin powder, salt to taste, lemon juice, fried onions and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for 30-40 minutes.",
      "In a cooker, add mustard oil, oil, once itâs hot, add black cardamom, green cardamom, bay leaf, cinnamon stick and let it splutter.",
      "Add garlic cloves, onion and saute it until golden in color.",
      "Add turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, coriander powder and mix it well.",
      "Add ginger, tender coriander stems and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add tomato, cover it with a lid and cook it for 2-3 whistles until cooked well.",
      "Mash it with the help of a masher and cook it for a while.",
      "Add marinated chicken, water and get a quick boil.",
      "Add salt to taste, ghee, prepared masala, coriander leaves and green chili.",
      "Cover it with a lid and cook it for 4-5 whistles until cooked well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti.",
      "In a bowl, add black pepper, cloves, black cardamom and salt to taste.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it smoothly.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
